 **Strengths and Limitations:**
-- Strengths: Physically plausible results for semi-transparent volumes; efficient early ray termination; simple implementation.
-- Limitations: Order-dependent (requires front-to-back sorting or traversal); not suitable for order-independent transparency without modification; early ray termination can cause artifacts if not handled carefully (e.g., in distributed rendering).
